IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `aa-audits`

-- Audit Act 1966, ss 3, 4, 4A, 6, 6A, 7 and 8 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_audit-act-1966.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

